ght=\"416\"></a></div><div class=\"mt-2 mb-6 lg:mb-0 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-2\" id=\"badges-desktop\"><a href=\"/en/question_categories/verification\" class=\"inline-flex relative items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold leading-none shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md hover:opacity-95 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-zest tooltip after:bg-black after:text-xs after:text-white cursor-pointer bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-600 text-emerald-950\" target=\"_blank\" data-tooltip-text=\"The seller has confirmed whether the vehicle is drivable.\"><i class=\"icon text-base leading-none\">fact_check</i><span>Function tested</span></a><a href=\"/en/question_categories/shipping\" class=\"inline-flex relative items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold leading-none shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md hover:opacity-95 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-zest tooltip after:bg-black after:text-xs after:text-white cursor-pointer bg-indigo-50 border-indigo-600 text-indigo-900\" target=\"_blank\" data-tooltip-text=\"Transport can be arranged for this vehicle.\"><i class=\"icon text-base leading-none\">local_shipping</i><span>Transport available</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-neutral-500 mt-8 mb-6 justify-between md:justify-start\"><a href=\"#data-sheet\" class=\"flex pb-3 border-black gap-2 items-center text-sm sm:text-base border-b text-black\">Overview</a><a href=\"#bid-container\" class=\"flex pb-3 border-black gap-2 items-center text-sm sm:text-base\"><span>Bids</span><span class=\"text-xs h-5 px-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-500 text-off-white flex items-center justify-center\">4</span></a><a href=\"#comments\" class=\"flex pb-3 border-black gap-2 items-center text-sm sm:text-base\"><span>Comments</span><span class=\"text-xs h-5 px-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-500 text-off-white flex items-center justify-center\">2</span></a><a href=\"/en/auctions/1965-fiat-1500-de-luxe-rjz328-2/albums\" class=\"flex pb-3 border-black gap-2 items-center text-sm sm:text-base\"><span>Photos</span><span class=\"text-xs h-5 px-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-500 text-off-white flex items-center justify-center\">130</span></a></div><div class=\"mb-8 p-6 bg-white rounded-lg border-l-4 border-racing-700\"><blockquote class=\"mb-4\"><p class=\"md:text-lg italic text-neutral-700 mb-0\">“1965 FIAT 1500 De Luxe in fair condition for its age. Refurbished engine and other mechanics in good condition. Minor work can be done on the body. ”</p></blockquote><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"icon w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-400 text-3xl flex items-center justify-center\">account_circle</i><div><div class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900\">Fredrik Persson</div><div class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-600\">Responsible consignor</div></div></div></div><h2 class=\"font-semibold text-xl mb-4\" id=\"data-sheet\">Data sheet</h2><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 mb-8 max-w-3xl\"><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Year: </span><span>1965</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Manufacturer: </span><span>Fiat</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Model: </span><span>1500 De Luxe</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Color: </span><span>Red</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Interior color: </span><span>Grey</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Interior material: </span><span>Fabric</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Engine displacement: </span><span>1.5</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Drive: </span><span>Rear-wheel drive</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Propulsion: </span><span>Gasoline</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Steering: </span><span>LHD</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Transmission: </span><span>Manual</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-1 col-span-2\"><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">VIN: </span><span class=\"flex gap-1 items-center relative\"><span>5075***</span><span class=\"bg-red-50 border-rose-100 text-au-chico tooltip after:bg-red-50 after:border-rose-100 rounded-full flex items-center\" data-tooltip-text=\"To view this vehicle's VIN number you'll need be logged in. Create your account now, it only takes a minute!\"><span class=\"icon\">info</span></span></span></li></ul><div class=\"auction-body\"><h2>Basic information and history</h2><p> The 1965 FIAT 1500 De Luxe is the refined version of the 1300/1500 family, known for its balanced chassis geometry, distinctive steering feel (for the time) and a refined four-cylinder, four-stroke engine with overhead valves. The model combines period Italian design with simple, robust mechanics that make it attractive to enthusiasts who appreciate a light-footed character and easy handling. The De Luxe version was marked by a more lavish interior and detailed finish.</p><p> This car was bought new in Överkalix by the last owner's paternal uncle in 1965 and was therefore sold in Sweden from the start. According to the seller, the car was scrapped around 1973 and stored in a cold garage in Yttre Lansjärv, removed from the car register with the then BD plates. The ownership history has been within the same family since new: first the original owner, then an inheritance within the family, then the seller's father who took the car into his possession around 2014. When taken over, the engine had rusted solid. The engine was taken down and received new bearings and piston rings, as well as two replaced pistons and work on the cylinder head where valves were replaced and valve seats were remilled and the radiator was renovated with a new element. The water pump was also replaced. The car was registered again in 2016. The current seller then took over the car and continued the work. The clutch with pressure plate has also been replaced. In connection with the engine work, the engine compartment was painted.</p><p> According to the seller, the upholstery and paint are considered original. The car has been wet sanded and polished in recent years to lift the surface without repainting, while maintaining the patina.</p><h2> Equipment and options</h2><ul><li> De Luxe Package</li><li> Sold in Sweden</li><li> Weber carburetor</li><li> Manual four-speed gearbox and rear-wheel drive</li><li> Front disc brakes and rear drum brakes</li></ul> <strong>Modifications and improvements:</strong> The engine has been overhauled with new bearings and piston rings and two replaced pistons. The cylinder head has new valves and re-milled seats. The radiator has a new element, the water pump has been replaced and the exhaust system has been replaced all the way through. The clutch and pressure plate have been replaced. The engine compartment has been repainted in connection with the engine work. The body has been polished in 2015 and 2025. The front brake discs and rear drums have been overhauled in 2025.<h2> Condition</h2><p> <strong>Body and exterior condition:</strong> Original red paint with a clear contemporary patina. Several scratches and minor dents. Some rust has begun to bubble on the front fenders under the chrome strips and there are occasional rust spots according to the seller. Chrome, strips, headlight lenses and emblems are in working condition with light tarnishing. Turn signal lenses have lost color. Glass surfaces in very good condition. Engine compartment was painted during the renovation.</p><p> <strong>Interior:</strong> Very good overall impression according to the seller and probably original upholstery. The driver's seat has a small hole in the felt fabric. The foam padding around the instruments has dried and is falling like flour. The headliner is complete and in good condition but slightly yellowed with age. The steering wheel's bakelite is cracked. The door panels and sill trims show light wear on the felt trims, sills and lower parts.</p><p> <strong>Tires and rims:</strong> Fulda EcoControl 155/80 R13 manufactured in 2014, tread depth approximately five to six millimeters. Age should be taken into account when driving regularly.</p><p> <strong>Mechanics and function:</strong> The engine runs as it should according to the seller. The gearbox and driveline are stated to be in good condition. The brake system has been overhauled with refurbished discs and drums in 2025.</p><h2> Service history</h2><p> <strong>Circa 2014:</strong> Engine disassembled, new bearings and piston rings installed, two pistons replaced.</p><p> <strong>2015:</strong> Body polished to restore shine without repainting.</p><p> <strong>2016:</strong> Re-registered in traffic after a long layoff.</p><p> <strong>Then:</strong> Cylinder head renovation with new valves and re-milled seats. Radiator renovated with new element. Water pump replaced. Entire exhaust system replaced. Clutch and pressure plate replaced. Engine compartment painted in connection with the work.</p><p> <strong>2025:</strong> Body polished. Service with mineral oil and oil filter. Brake renovation of front discs and rear drums.</p><p> <strong>Documentation:</strong> History from the original owner is available according to the seller. A complete service book or receipts in a coherent sequence are not stated to exist.</p><h2> Summary</h2>\n<p>A Swedish-sold FIAT 1500 De Luxe from 1965 with a coherent family history, retained original paint and probably also original interior. The car has received an extensive technical review where the engine, cooling system, exhaust system, clutch and brakes have been repaired, while the body's patina has been preserved. On the exterior there are scratches, minor dents and incipient rust in the front fenders, but the overall impression is an honestly presented utility and enthusiast car with a correct period feel. For those who want to preserve the original feel, there is a stable foundation with fresh mechanics. For those who aim for an exhibition finish, bodywork and repainting are required. This car is aimed at the enthusiast who prioritizes construction quality, easy-to-service technology and a clear link to FIAT's sixties heritage.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 bg-white border border-green-200 rounded-md shadow-sm p-2 md:p-3\"><h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-800\">Function Check</h3><ul class=\"mt-3 grid gap-x-3 md:gap-y-1 grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4\"><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Drivable</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Lighting</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Engine</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Brakes</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Clutch</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Gearbox</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-neutral-300 text-sm text-neutral-500 mb-12\">The description of this auction item is, to the seller's knowledge, accurate and not misleading. Bidders Highway gathers details from the seller and performs some background checks, but does not carry out a full inspection, and the transaction is between the buyer and the seller. It is up to the bidder to ensure the description is correct and to do any research they deem necessary before placing a binding bid. <b>Study the many images carefully and form your own opinion on the condition, and use the comments section to ask questions.</b> See our general terms and conditions for full details.</div><div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6 text-sm\"><div class=\"text-center\">Do you also own a Fiat 1500 De Luxe or similar? <a class=\"underline hover:text-zest transition-colors\" href=\"/en/sales_inquiries/new\">Contact us</a> and we'll quickly put you in touch with our sales specialists.</div></div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">2 Comments</h2><div class=\"mb-16\"><span class=\"block border bg-rose-50 text-neutral-600 p-4 my-4 rounded\">You need to be signed in in order to post comments.</span><ul id=\"comments\"><li id=\"comment_01a0ec4a-7d41-7e34-a8d1-69e73b489124\" class=\"comment transition-colors mt-6 mb-2\"><div class=\"flex gap-2 text-lg items-center mb-2\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-sm md:text-base\">Sonett97</strong><span class=\"text-neutral-500 text-sm md:text-base\">September 29, 2026 10:31</span></div><div class=\"text-neutral-700 pb-2\"><p>Kan jag titta på bilen och proköra ?</p></div></li><li id=\"comment_01a0ec6f-a624-733a-87b5-028bcaaa0a77\" class=\"comment transition-colors pl-4 py-1 pb-2 lg:ml-2 border-l-neutral-300 border-l\"><div class=\"flex gap-2 text-lg items-center mb-2\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-sm md:text-base\">Gizmo56</strong><span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-700 font-normal bg-white rounded-full inline-block py-1 px-2 whitespace-nowrap\">Seller</span><span class=\"text-neutral-500 text-sm md:text-base\">September 29, 2026 11:12</span></div><div class=\"text-neutral-700 pb-2\"><p>Hej !\n<br>Den finns i Söderköping och står färdig att köra.\n<br>Med vänlig hälsning \n<br>Johan </p></div></li></ul></div><h2 class=\"font-serif uppercase text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-racing-700 mb-6\">Similar listings</h2><div id=\"recommended-listings\" class=\"grid gap-6 md